{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8b438a48-53b5-8c8d-8b7a-13be2e46acda",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T09:15:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning, and happy Christmas Eve. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. Diogo Amaral here. I'm calling about the storm drain out front of my place, 455 Old Beach Road, Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 455 Old Beach Road. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's grunting. Slow, real slow. Any time we get a little thaw, the snow melts off and the water just sits there and backs up into the road. No storm, nothing. It's dry out, I'm looking at it right now and there's still a puddle from yesterday's warm-up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So it's not draining even when there's no big rain, just the melt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Every thaw. I've been watching it a while now. It's a nuisance, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you're coming through a little tinny. Are you on speaker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I got the phone on the speaker, my hands are full. Is that better? I'll pick it up. No, hold on, I'll leave it. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, just a little echoey. No problem. So water's backing up in the street in front of the house. Does it get onto your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gets up into the driveway, sure. But it's the neighbor I worry about more. Older lady next door, she can't get out when it pools like that. She's got the walker, she's not stepping through a foot of slush water. So she's stuck inside till it goes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. I'll put that in the notes, that there's an older neighbor who has trouble getting out when it backs up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. So what I want to know is, are you gonna open a work order on this? And what date, can you tell me a date somebody comes out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:18-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can open the request right now, that part's easy. As for a date, I can't give you one off the top. The crew supervisor schedules those, and this week with the holiday it's going to be thin. Somebody will look at the drain, probably clean it out if it's clogged, but I don't have a day for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So no date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not from me today. What I can do is put it down as a drain that's slow in dry weather with a vulnerable neighbor, so it doesn't get lumped in with the storm calls. And if you want, I'll note your callback number so the supervisor can reach you with a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:14:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight zero, got it. And that's Diogo, D-I-O-G-O, Amaral?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. A-M-A-R-A-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I've got 455 Old Beach Road, storm drain in front draining slow, backs up on every thaw, no storm involved, older neighbor affected, callback number noted. Work order's open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I figured it'd be something like that. I'd just like somebody to come before it freezes up solid out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll flag that in the notes too. If it ices over, call us back and we'll bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kevin. Thanks. Merry Christmas."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Amaral. Take care."
    }
  ],
